 "title": "Forms - Country Partners Cooperative",
 "text": "Forms - Country Partners Cooperative\nMain\nUtilities\nOur Story\nOverview\nLeadership\nAdmin Staff\nCommunity\nAgronomy\nPrecision\nSeed Programs\nAgronomy Staff\nAgronomy Locations\nGrain\nGrain Staff\nCash Bids\nFutures\nCommentary\nContracts\nPolicies\nWeather\nEnergy\nServices\nEnergy Staff\nRetail Locations\nFeed\nFeed Staff\nFeed Locations\nCareers\nLocations\nContact Us\nForms\nCountry Partners Connect\nCareers\nLocations\nContact Us\nForms\nCountry Partners Connect\nFORMS\nFINANCE FORMS & INFORMATION\nCredit Information\nThanks to a close working relationship with three financing sources, Country Partners is able to offer our patrons a convenient source of input and livestock financing. Now it’s easy to line up financing for seed, fertilizer and crop protection products at the same place you purchase your inputs. If you have any questions, we encourage you to contact our credit department at 308-537-7141 for more information.\nMEMBERSHIP APPLICATION FORM\nCREDIT POLICY\nElectronic Bill Pay\nCountry Partners Cooperative offers Electronic Bill Pay. If you are interested in having your statement balance pulled automatically from your bank account, please fill out the Electronic Funds Transfer Authorization Form and return to any Country Partners location. The funds will be pulled automatically from your account on the 15th of every month.\nELECTRONIC FUNDS TRANSFER AUTHORIZATION FORM\nCrop Input Financing\nCountry Partners Cooperative partnering with the Cooperative Finance Association:\nCompetitive rates\nFlexible payment dates\nOne-stop source for all your input needs\nMaximize potential – lock-in input costs\nSpecial rates for seed and chemicals\n| Easy loan application process\nConvenient\nCustom tailored to your operation\nAg input products and services\nLoans serviced locally\n|\nCFA 2024 CROP INPUT FINANCE PROGRAM BROCHURE\nApplying?\nCompleted applications can be mailed to:\nJanell Rossen\nCountry Partners Cooperative\nPO Box 80\nGothenburg, NE 69138.\nCFA APPLICATION FORM\nGas Card\nTake advantage of our Cardtrol stations by using a Country Partners Gas Card.\nGAS CARD AGREEMENT\nDONATIONS\nSupporting the growth of the next generation of leaders through participation in the Nebraska FFA Foundation’s I Believe in the Future of Ag program, financial support of ag awareness and education, scholarships and our internship program is one of our priorities. Matching funds from our cooperative partners—CoBank, the Land O’Lakes® Foundation, and CHS—help our donation dollars make an even greater impact.\nCONTACT US\nPO Box 80 • 120 8th Street\nGothenburg, NE 69138\n308-537-7141\nOur Story\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nFeed\nGrain\nCareers\nLocations\nContact Us\nForms\nCountry Partners Connect\nConnect with Country Partners\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 Country Partners Cooperative - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 character allowed.",
